   "firstViewTextSample": "Introducing Skills\n\nLearn more\n\n→\n\n→\n\nProduct\n\nSolutions\n\nSecurity\n\nCustomers\n\nCompany\n\nLog in\n\nBook a demo\n\nLegal work, without limits.\n\nCollaborative AI for exceptional lawyers\n\nBook a demo\n\nTrusted by\n\nIntroducing the Legora aOS™\n\nThe agentic operating system for legal work\n\nLarge Language Models\n\nAgentic Harness\n\nData & Integrations\n\nContext & Knowledge\n\nLegal Capabilities\n\nProducts & Interfaces\n\nSecurity & Governance\n\nA single system that connects information, communication, and the execution of legal work.\n\nExplore the Legora aOS™\n\nOur latest innovations\n\nEarlier this spring we hosted Precedent in London, our annual summit on the future of law and AI. We gathered some of the most influential voices in the industry, and unveiled our latest product innovations.\n\nLegora aOS™\n\nThe Legora aOS facilitates the flow of information, communication, and execution of legal work, helping lawyers deliver higher quality work at unprecedented speed and scale.\n\n↳\n\n \n\nRead more\n\nAgent\n\nEnd-to-end execution of complex legal work. The Agent plans, executes, reviews and delivers, so you can focus on the decisions that require your judgment.\n\n↳\n\n \n\nRead more\n\nMonitors\n\nStay ahead of regulatory change. Monitors cuts through the noise by continuously scanning global regulation and surfacing what matters before it impacts your business.\n\n↳\n\n \n\nRead more\n\nLists\n\nKeep legal work organised, owned, and connected. Lists can be generated by the Agent directly from your documents, connecting AI output",
